# ---- what Atlas has and should not ----
# a value one arm of the choice makes, and only that arm takes, has the choice's moment; two (`Rates·rates`) become one
# a value handed to a call into a family ends at the dispatch's border
# the format the arm's pattern binds out of `cli` comes from beyond
# an own arrow takes what only a step inside it takes, and a value is not followed into the operation a body hands it to
# a result that only a step takes is no result handed back
# the name a chain's last operation gives is given to every call in the chain
# the else of a `let .. else` is no choice

# ---- an error is a value in the codomain: made where it is raised, handed on at each border it crosses uncaught ----
